  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A double-ended makeup brush made for easy, on-the-go blending; its compact size slips right into your bag for quick touch-ups anytime, anywhere.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> Pocket Brush is a compact tool for easy, on-the-go blending. The angled brush helps place bronzer with soft precision along the cheekbones and jawline, while the round brush diffuses blush on the apples of your cheeks.</p><p><br></p><p style=\"margin:0in;background:white;\"><br></p><p><br></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p>-Use the angled end to blend out bronzer along the cheekbones and jawline.</p><p>-Use the rounded end to diffuse blush on the apples of your cheeks.</p></div></details>",
